OL,3,GNEWSAKings of Leon and Bastille join
OL,4,ALytham line-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FKings of Leon, The Corrs, David Gray,
OL,7,FBastille, James Morrison and Emily
OL,8,FRhodes are all joining next year's
OL,9,FLytham Festival line-up.
OL,11,FThey join headliners DJ Fatboy Slim and
OL,12,FRobbie Williams, whose show on Saturday
OL,13,F3 July has already sold out.
OL,15,FKings of Leon will headline the opening
OL,16,Fnight on Lytham Green on 30 June,
OL,17,Fjoined by Bastille.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
